The example python script -- does nothing...

## about python and Ubuntu 24.04 ##
###################################

pip is broken, and pipx is not the solution!  Instead, get pip working
as described in
https://ubuntuhandbook.org/index.php/2024/03/pip-install-error-ubuntu-2404.
Basically the following.

    pip install --user imagesearch --break-system-packages
    mkdir -p ~/.config/pip
    echo -e "[global]\nbreak-system-packages=true" > ~/.config/pip/pip.conf
    cat ~/.config/pip/pip.conf

~/.config/pip/pip.conf should have something like the following.

    [global]
    break-system-packages=true

